{"annotations":{"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Hosted only. Evaluate every alert on your alert_token against the current feed. Each alert is fired, not_triggered, skipped_stale, not_in_feed or expired; `new` is false when the same price was already reported. renew=true first extends every unexpired alert to 30 days from now. Never fires on a held_stale row or a row whose last price verification is older than 48 hours (data_age_hours is measured from the row's verified_at, or checked_at if verified_at is missing, not from feed write time): those are listed in skipped_stale with would_have_crossed, and a crossing on stale data is not a fire. would_have_crossed is not stored; the next check_alerts re-evaluates the current feed, and a now-fresh row can fire then if the current price still crosses (that is not a delayed fire of the stale crossing).","inputSchema":{"properties":{"alert_token":{"type":"string"},"renew":{"default":false,"type":"boolean"}},"type":"object"},"name":"check_alerts","outputSchema":{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"alerts":{"items":{"properties":{"alert_id":{"type":"string"},"direction":{"type":["string","null"]},"expires_at":{"type":["string","null"]},"fired":{"items":{"properties":{"checked_at":{"type":["string","null"]},"gpu":{"type":["string","null"]},"hold":{"type":"string"},"hourly_usd":{"type":["number","null"]},"in_stock":{"type":["boolean","null"]},"price_age_hours":{"type":["number","null"]},"rate_id":{"type":"string"},"reason":{"type":["string","null"]},"source_url":{"type":["string","null"]},"tier":{"type":["string","null"]},"vendor":{"type":["string","null"]},"vram_gb":{"type":["integer","null"]},"would_have_crossed":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["rate_id","vendor","gpu","hourly_usd"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"new":{"type":"boolean"},"skipped_stale":{"items":{"properties":{"checked_at":{"type":["string","null"]},"gpu":{"type":["string","null"]},"hold":{"type":"string"},"hourly_usd":{"type